     "html": "Groups of atoms bonded together, like H₂O.",
     "why": "The name was made famous by the Italian <b>Amedeo Avogadro</b> (1811), who was the first to understand the difference between atoms and molecules: for example that oxygen gas is made of pairs of atoms (O₂)."
